 "Every message consists of INPUT and OUTPUT paper. INPUT PAPER must ALWAYS be stamped with ECHO STAMPER. Output paper requires different stamps or signatures, depending on the mission type. Output papers are pulled from two drawers on your left.\n\nIf a message is not authentic: stamp it FALSE ECHO and give it back right away. If a message is authentic, stamp TRUE ECHO, process the message, clip input and output together and give them back.": "每条消息都由输入纸与输出纸组成。 输入纸必须始终盖上回响印章。输出 纸则视任务类型需要盖不同的印章或 签名；输出纸从你左手边的两个抽屉 中取用。\r\n\r\n若消息不真实：盖上伪回响印章并立 即交还。若消息属实：盖上真回响印 章，处理该消息，将输入纸与输出纸 一起别好并交还。",
 "For minor infractions you will receive citations. You must bring each citation to the table and shred it before progressing. Major infractions or too many citations will result in a court-martial.\n\nEach incorrect letter deducts ": "轻微违规会收到训诫书。你必须把每 张训诫书带到桌前并用碎纸机销毁后 才能继续。严重违规或训诫书过多将 导致军事法庭审判。\r\n\r\n每个错误字母扣除 ",
 "Thank you for playing the False Echo demo.\n\nThis is only the first part of the voyage. The full game will continue with the remaining days, new missions, and the consequences of your decisions.\n\nIf you have feedback, bug reports, or thoughts, please reach us through Discord or our social channels. Your reviews and wishlists help bring the full voyage to life.": "感谢游玩《虚妄回响》Demo。\r\n\r\n这只是航程的第一部分。完整版将继 续剩余的日程、新的任务，以及你所 作决定带来的后果。\r\n\r\n如果你有反馈、Bug 报告或想法，欢 迎通过 Discord 或我们的社交渠道 联系我们。你的评价与愿望单能让这 段完整的航程得以成真。",
